# The control for `sideshift-double-tap-clean.inputs`: the same file with the
# two `l` tokens dropped, so the two scripts are tick-for-tick identical except
# for the gesture itself. Any divergence between the two is the sideshift and
# nothing else - see `sideshift-double-tap-clean.inputs` and
# `handover/sideshift-has-no-runtime-leg.md`.

# Reach speed on the opening straight, short enough to clear the wall.
130 cross

# Where the double tap alone lived. Ticks preserved so the two scripts stay
# frame-aligned.
1 cross
3 cross

1 cross

# Hold the line through the window the shift and lockout would have covered.
100 cross
